# DN-05 - request mau (IntelliJ HTTP Client hoac VS Code REST Client).
# Chay truoc: mock (9000), identity va company-service voi profile dev, gateway (8080). Xem docs/api/DN-05-company-hr-ui.md muc "Cach chay".
# Chay tu tren xuong: kich ban khoa/mo khoa hr2 (cong ty B). Muc 6 tra hr2 ve trang thai mo khoa.

@gw = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@A = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000a1
@B = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000b2
@hr2 = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000002

############################## 1. Token cua staff1 (SSO) ##############################

### 1a. Xin ve SSO cho staff1 (chi dev) -> 200 {ticket, issuedAt}
# @name staffTicket
POST {{gw}}/auth/dev/sso-ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lmsUserId": "lms-st-001" }

### 1b. Doi ve lay token (trong 60 giay, dung mot lan) -> 200 {accessToken, user}
# @name staffSso
POST {{gw}}/auth/sso
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticket": "{{staffTicket.response.body.ticket}}" }

############################## 2. Danh sach, tim kiem, chi tiet ##############################

### 2a. Danh sach (trang 1, 20 dong, moi nhat truoc) -> 200 { items, total, page, size }; jdCount luon 0
GET {{gw}}/staff/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2b. Tim theo ten -> 200, 2 dong (Cong ty A, B). Khong phan biet hoa thuong nhung PHAN BIET dau: "cong ty" khong khop "Công ty"
GET {{gw}}/staff/companies?q=C%C3%B4ng%20ty
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2c. Tim theo ma so thue (Cong ty A) -> 200, 1 dong
GET {{gw}}/staff/companies?q=0101234567
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2d. Loc theo trang thai cong ty -> 200
GET {{gw}}/staff/companies?status=ACTIVE&page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2e. Phan trang sai -> 400 BAD_REQUEST
GET {{gw}}/staff/companies?page=0&size=500
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2f. Chi tiet cong ty A kem hrAccounts (hr1, hr-new) -> 200 StaffCompanyDetail
GET {{gw}}/staff/companies/{{A}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

############################## 3. Khoa hr2 ##############################

### 3a. hr2 dang nhap truoc khi bi khoa -> 200 (giu token nay de thu 3d)
# @name hr2Login
POST {{gw}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hr2@rikkeijobs.test", "password": "Test@123" }

### 3b. Khoa thieu ly do -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, errors.reason
POST {{gw}}/staff/hr-accounts/{{hr2}}/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "   " }

### 3c. Khoa hr2 kem ly do -> 200 StaffHrAccount { status: "LOCKED", lockedReason, lockedAt }
POST {{gw}}/staff/hr-accounts/{{hr2}}/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Vi pham dieu khoan dang tin" }

### 3d. Token hr2 cu van con han nhung bi chan -> 401 ACCOUNT_DISABLED "Tai khoan da bi khoa"
GET {{gw}}/companies/me
Authorization: Bearer {{hr2Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3e. hr2 dang nhap lai -> 403 ACCOUNT_DISABLED
POST {{gw}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hr2@rikkeijobs.test", "password": "Test@123" }

### 3f. Chi tiet cong ty B thay hr2 LOCKED kem ly do -> 200
GET {{gw}}/staff/companies/{{B}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3g. userId khong phai HR cua cong ty nao (staff1) -> 404 NOT_FOUND
POST {{gw}}/staff/hr-accounts/00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000005/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Thu" }

############################## 4. HR khac van binh thuong ##############################

### 4a. hr1 (cong ty A) dang nhap -> 200
# @name hr1Login
POST {{gw}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hr1@rikkeijobs.test", "password": "Test@123" }

### 4b. hr1 xem cong ty cua minh -> 200 "Cong ty A"
GET {{gw}}/companies/me
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4c. Khong phai STAFF (token hr1 tu 4a) goi API can bo -> 403 FORBIDDEN
GET {{gw}}/staff/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

############################## 5. Mo khoa hr2 ##############################

### 5a. Mo khoa -> 200 StaffHrAccount { status: "ACTIVE", lockedReason: null }
POST {{gw}}/staff/hr-accounts/{{hr2}}/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5b. hr2 dang nhap lai -> 200
# @name hr2Login2
POST {{gw}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hr2@rikkeijobs.test", "password": "Test@123" }

### 5c. hr2 xem cong ty cua minh -> 200 "Cong ty B"
GET {{gw}}/companies/me
Authorization: Bearer {{hr2Login2.response.body.accessToken}}

############################## 6. API noi bo moi (KHONG qua gateway) ##############################

### 6a. Thieu khoa -> 401 INVALID_SERVICE_KEY
PATCH http://localhost:8081/internal/users/{{hr2}}/lock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Thu" }

### 6b. Tra cuu hang loat (id la bi bo qua) -> 200 [InternalUserStatusResponse]
POST http://localhost:8081/internal/users/lookup
X-Internal-Key: dev-internal-key
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userIds": ["{{hr2}}", "00000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000dead"] }

### 6c. Danh sach rong -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST http://localhost:8081/internal/users/lookup
X-Internal-Key: dev-internal-key
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userIds": [] }
